{
  "family": "engine-mode",
  "module": "player/engine-contract.js",
  "note": "EngineMode.decideOnce as a pure table (docs/native-engine-plan.md §4.6; player/engine-contract.js decideEngineMode and engineModeTrace, NE-11j): an absent plist key is legacy with reason no-plist-key; a strike only for a still-set sentinel; three clean background launches give 0 strikes; sticky legacy until CFBundleVersion changes; a setting change clears; a page-health strike. Ported by NE-11s to EngineMode.swift; NE-17 wraps it in decideOnce().",
